13
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:33,820
I won't stop

14
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,820
Where else in the apocalypse

15
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:35,820
Safer than World King

16
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:36,820
I won't leave

17
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,820
Me too

18
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:38,820
Bring important items

19
